Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): project lanes: classify at creation, gate
 agent-filed cards, soft shares in dispatch order [daveey]

A card's lane is tasks.tenant; kanban.admission.lanes names them. Unconfigured is a no-op.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
